notes.notes:
Defenders of Eviron, the following changes have taken place in the world today:
- the system of Daily Quests has been changed. There are more of them and they are aimed at all aspects of the game;

- the chains of all achievements have been increased and the rewards for them have been changed;

- the Avatars and Shirts sections will disappear from the Eviron Store. Now they will not be sold, but will be a reward for activities;

- Free goods in the store will now appear not once a day, but once every 12 hours;

- Upgrade of cards system is changed. It was from 1 up to 5 level and now you can upgrade cards from 0 up to 6 level! 

These changes are the first steps in our improvement work. Changes to Crypts, General's Armors and more will follow soon!
